###

# 测试 CORS 预检请求
OPTIONS http://127.0.0.1:8000/cors/ HTTP/1.1
Origin: http://localhost:5173
Access-Control-Request-Method: GET

### SQLModel 1：检查 PostgreSQL 连接，预期 200
GET {{dbBase}}/health

### SQLModel 2：一次事务创建队伍和两个英雄，预期 201
# @name createSqlTeam
POST {{dbBase}}/teams/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Knights-{{$timestamp}}",
    "headquarters": "Mondstadt",
    "heroes": [
        {"name": "Eula-{{$timestamp}}", "secret_name": "Eula Lawrence", "age": 25},
        {"name": "Amber-{{$timestamp}}", "secret_name": "Outrider", "age": 20}
    ]
}

### SQLModel 3：分页查询队伍
GET {{dbBase}}/teams/?offset=0&limit=10

### SQLModel 4：查询队伍及其英雄，响应不会暴露 secret_name
GET {{dbBase}}/teams/{{createSqlTeam.response.body.$.id}}

### SQLModel 5：单独创建英雄并加入刚创建的队伍
# @name createSqlHero
POST {{dbBase}}/heroes/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Lisa-{{$timestamp}}",
    "secret_name": "Librarian",
    "age": 28,
    "team_id": {{createSqlTeam.response.body.$.id}}
}

### SQLModel 6：分页、名字模糊搜索、队伍和年龄筛选、排序；total 是筛选后的总数
GET {{dbBase}}/heroes/?q=a&team_id={{createSqlTeam.response.body.$.id}}&min_age=20&offset=0&limit=2&sort_by=age&descending=true

### SQLModel 7：查询单个英雄，包含所属队伍
GET {{dbBase}}/heroes/{{createSqlHero.response.body.$.id}}

### SQLModel 8：PATCH 只更新传入的年龄，其他字段保持不变
PATCH {{dbBase}}/heroes/{{createSqlHero.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"age": 29}

### SQLModel 9：显式 null 清空年龄、解除队伍关联
PATCH {{dbBase}}/heroes/{{createSqlHero.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"age": null, "team_id": null}

### SQLModel 10：更新队伍
PATCH {{dbBase}}/teams/{{createSqlTeam.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"headquarters": "New Mondstadt HQ"}

### SQLModel 11：重复名称触发数据库唯一约束，预期 409
POST {{dbBase}}/heroes/
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "{{createSqlHero.response.body.$.name}}", "secret_name": "Duplicate"}

### SQLModel 12：批量事务失败，第二个英雄重名，整个新队伍和第一个英雄也不会入库（409）
POST {{dbBase}}/teams/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "RollbackTeam-{{$timestamp}}",
    "headquarters": "Must not persist",
    "heroes": [
        {"name": "RollbackHero-{{$timestamp}}", "secret_name": "Temporary"},
        {"name": "{{createSqlHero.response.body.$.name}}", "secret_name": "Duplicate"}
    ]
}

### SQLModel 13：检查上一条事务已经回滚，items 为空、total 为 0
GET {{dbBase}}/heroes/?q=RollbackHero-

### SQLModel 14：年龄范围验证，预期 422
POST {{dbBase}}/heroes/
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "InvalidHero", "secret_name": "Invalid", "age": -1}

### SQLModel 15：名称可以不传，但不能传 null，预期 422
PATCH {{dbBase}}/heroes/{{createSqlHero.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": null}

### SQLModel 16：禁止删除仍有英雄的队伍，预期 409
DELETE {{dbBase}}/teams/{{createSqlTeam.response.body.$.id}}

### SQLModel 17：删除单独创建的英雄，预期 204（无响应体）
DELETE {{dbBase}}/heroes/{{createSqlHero.response.body.$.id}}

### SQLModel 18：查询刚删除的英雄，预期 404
GET {{dbBase}}/heroes/{{createSqlHero.response.body.$.id}}

### SQLModel 19：清理本组请求创建的第一个队伍成员，预期 204
DELETE {{dbBase}}/heroes/{{createSqlTeam.response.body.$.heroes[0].id}}

### SQLModel 20：清理第二个队伍成员，预期 204
DELETE {{dbBase}}/heroes/{{createSqlTeam.response.body.$.heroes[1].id}}

### SQLModel 21：所有成员移除后，允许删除队伍，预期 204
DELETE {{dbBase}}/teams/{{createSqlTeam.response.body.$.id}}

### 测试高级教程的 直接返回响应
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/response/itemresponse/111
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "111"
}